            <ArticleTitle>Management techniques for chronic pain of the upper extremity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>381-405</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pain is a psychologic, social, and economic problem. Two principles involved in the treatment of a chronic pain syndrome are noted. Several examples of subjective symptom patterns are presented with recommended specific techniques for treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
